"此版本使用 macOS 标准鼠标事件，不识别特定鼠标连接状态，也不读取电量或修改 DPI、SmartShift。侧键映射同样适用于其他鼠标。前进／后退使用 ⌘[ / ⌘]，可按应用需要改为自定义快捷键。\n\n仅保存你的设置；无网络请求、无使用统计，不记录键盘输入。设置不会写入鼠标，退出应用后恢复原始行为。" = "This version uses standard macOS mouse events. It does not detect individual mouse connections, read battery levels, or change DPI or SmartShift. Side button mappings also apply to other mice. Back and Forward use ⌘[ / ⌘]; choose custom shortcuts if your app needs different keys.\n\nOnly your settings are saved. No network requests, analytics, or keystroke logging. Settings are not written to the mouse; quitting restores its original behavior.";
